<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Pacific Andes shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Pacific Andes shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of frozen seafood supplier Pacific Andes International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares closed HK$0.01 higher at HK$1.27 on Friday with 2.6 million shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
